{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "155f5abe144b618683861a67497423224240a2f4e14ec846c86aab0dc5303cc1", "ja": "運動は嫌いじゃないし、体を鍛えて、\n筋トレして力をつけて……。", "zh": "我也不讨厌运动，锻炼身体，做做力量训练，增强体力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "d7bf726d3ec5c232a6d62989487d37b7c73b6ad75962140148ae463f26371a32", "ja": "体力がつけば、お裁縫のスピードだって上がっちゃう\nかも！？　意外にいいアイディアかも……！", "zh": "要是体力变好了，连缝纫的速度说不定也会变快！？没准是个意外的好主意……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "b9117a6fa434d1bd9d2a43446c0035475b32c53d1fa606b342e24b48b73ba084", "ja": "シュッシュッ！　私の右待ち針のスピードに、\n付いてこれるかな！？　シュシュシュッ！", "zh": "咻咻！你能跟上我右手持针的速度吗！？咻咻咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8d6814beaffb5da02e3326385ae7183cd6214ecfa2424db4454177f075a7ec54", "ja": "（……青羽さん？　……ここしばらく\n普通だったけど、最近暑かったからな……）", "zh": "（……青羽小姐？……这段时间明明一直挺正常的，不过最近天气很热啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5cb40d75c34784251f10a9bca04244f719e1cb05db7f8ab510894c29d5929e49", "ja": "（こういう時は見ないふりをするのがマナー。\nこっそり通り過ぎて……）", "zh": "这种时候，装作没看见才是礼貌。悄悄地走过去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1006_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "da7715793fee1a084464f37b233293dd07dd2716794b19e2eeb8cada91f23595", "ja": "あれ？　{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです、そんな所でどうしたんですか？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了，您怎么会在这种地方呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "100d5636fe9c453e0c4c7df49aad0f64ff24039d179e036be3c75d9094c07dc1", "ja": "あっ、お、お疲れさまです。\n青羽さん……。", "zh": "啊，辛、辛苦了。青羽小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "622523a0c0bfa3f1d36d0832ebda1aa3cdf4fb326b03a386bd08d7ce632d6313", "ja": "私に何か御用ですか？　あ、手に持っている\n資料は、もしかして新しい衣装の……！", "zh": "您找我有什么事吗？啊，您手里拿的资料，难道是新服装的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3b7def59b0e9b402138baf1b48f1a8ab704d77908c3dbcedf5cef8d184b64c6f", "ja": "いえ！　これはまだ調整中で……そうだ、\nこの件で事務所に向かわなくちゃいけないんです。", "zh": "不！　这个还在调整中……对了，\n我正得为了这件事回一趟事务所呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "9b285a110358bcd810af1286a1e2ef3276246801b8cca59563538b4331a2463e", "ja": "そういえば社長さんからそんな伝言を……\nまだお時間には早い気がしますけど……？", "zh": "说起来，社长好像是托人传了这样的话……\n不过现在去是不是还早了点……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "55d588065a93206c591ebc4e59a3fa8b8054ac8e748cd54b35731787c5a8ebdf", "ja": "いえ、早めの行動は社会人の基本なので！\nそれではいってきます！", "zh": "不，提前行动是社会人的基本准则！\n那我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "528ecc670f0039872cdff763e8b5738ad61ee5f06d1f6620c99cffcbecf46059", "ja": "は、はい、いってらっしゃーい！\n……はっ、今みたいな感じでいいのかも……。", "zh": "啊、好的，路上小心——！\n……啊，这种感觉好像就可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "f877ca53fb2c42e0e3451802f669573d5383a30341322ea5bd5e3b6b1727212c", "ja": "びしっと言ってそのまま走り去る……うん！\n{$P$}さんのやり方、見習おうっと！", "zh": "干脆利落地说完就跑掉……嗯！\n我也要学习{$P$}先生的做法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1015_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "eae3354e04982de12d95bc97325936fe6d2d7f0e9602b820abbd0f1a5591d4b2", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです！\n少し早いんですが打ち合わせに来ました。", "zh": "社长、音无女士，辛苦了！\n我来得稍微早了一点，不过先过来开会了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "a5a64c2b96a4d7ff6829faa26beeffbe7e12c151b60bd620139ddef42dc664ef", "ja": "やあ君！　ちょうどこちらも資料が\nまとまったところだ。かけたまえ。", "zh": "哎呀，你来啦！我这边也正好\n把资料整理好。请坐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "cfeb749883d0fec0f0d6a825c391931e2a1edfb429f93817df9f8f9cc873be32", "ja": "ちょうどお菓子の用意をしてたんです。\nすぐにお茶を淹れますね。", "zh": "我正好在准备点心。马上给您泡茶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2c5663e1f54062e53afa5c6d325472db8bc7469292d180d1ec144d1ae3f2163d", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n音無さん。", "zh": "谢谢您。\n音无小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "3a603bdbe6b9dc384fe4fda8c0a81df85c3df430c9b9f6d5f4650b786b06ef57", "ja": "劇場のアイドル39人が、登場キャラクターを\n引き継ぎ演じる『STARDOM ROAD』公演……。", "zh": "剧场偶像39人接棒出演登场角色的《STARDOM ROAD》公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "f3d9fae575321df722d2db96099feeb4330aadd81e1506482cd1dea6b182dd9a", "ja": "第一幕からここまで無事に繋げて\nいるようだね。なによりだ！", "zh": "看来从第一幕到这里都顺利衔接上了。比什么都好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "0983e0cfff20caddeed7eaf986bd6e09571152b2d8e02827ab7fac926eb46faa", "ja": "お姉ちゃんの背中を追ってアイドルになった\n真珠星ちゃん達、いよいよデビューですね！", "zh": "追随着姐姐的脚步成为偶像的真珠星们，终于要出道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "3b7f37371ac3570b09d1758dc9af40e2d37d32fc8652471bf4677ae7780e05e7", "ja": "みんなも少しだけ年を取って、\n初めてのお仕事、学園ドラマに出演！", "zh": "大家也稍微长大了一些，第一次的工作是出演校园剧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "07142278cbd72bc4b4555bf467b948ec8a0c2aebf1239fe0d3f694e1f7d5d591", "ja": "そして新しく描かれる人間模様、\n今回の引きは……小鳥、かなり気になります！", "zh": "以及即将展开的全新人物关系，这次的悬念是……小鸟，我相当在意呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "5563af65f0e8bdd4762b6fed5aee26c01ce38a9dd5298a987d82285f01c44788", "ja": "はい。続き物のお話ですからね。\nならではの楽しみを仕組んであるつもりです。", "zh": "是的。毕竟这是个连载故事嘛。我特意设计了一些连载故事特有的乐趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "946b1cc20763752d929ff1764c3b647146555f12efc69c646a878a7f61b5452e", "ja": "うむ、やはり君に任せて正解だった。\n私の審美眼もまだまだ衰えてはいないようだ！", "zh": "嗯，果然交给你是对的。\n看来我的审美品味也还没有退步嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "4ee957248fe0441ee1d6d4cc0b9ae45f7094ce074c7122c8b6d6e88f3a1229bc", "ja": "もう、社長！　実際に頑張って働くのは、\n{$P$}さんなんですからね？", "zh": "真是的，社长！实际努力工作的可是\n{$P$}先生，您可别忘了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "3926f161bacd8fae7e0421f4cf9fd3e3bf2b32d00718fc9fcf01cd73611072fc", "ja": "そ、それはもちろんわかっているとも！\n第四幕の公演も、期待しているよ君！", "zh": "这、这个我当然明白啊！\n我也很期待第四幕的演出哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "7250de34b563e76289878d5ab9fd2535d00ef1e8ad1f3b34031dfff8747d0d89", "ja": "はい！\n全力でプロデュースしようと思います！", "zh": "好的！\n我会全力制作偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
